   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "A linear model is developed for the relationship between the annual salary of finance professionals and years of experience, and the following is the linear model <span data-math=\"\\widehat y=\\text{55,000}+\\text{1,000}x\"></span>. Which is the correct interpretation of this linear model?",
